// Title: Detect Microsoft Shared File Messages via InternetMessageId odspnotify value
// Source: https://www.kqlsearch.com/query/Detect%20Microsoft%20Shared%20File%20Messages%20via%20InternetMessageId%20odspnotify%20value&cmoast0w200013nlop8swlkiq
// Section: MITRE ATT&CK Technique(s)
// Author: Sergio Albea
