// Title: Detecting Copilot Studio Bot Creation.kql
// Source: https://www.kqlsearch.com/query/Detecting%20Copilot%20Studio%20Bot%20Creation&clzwgxxek00agmc0pmlrnesoi
// Section: KQL
// Author: Steven Lim
// Description:
// Detecting Copilot Studio Bot Creation
