// Title: Find which devices have been accessed by a compromised device and which protocol was used to connect
// Source: https://github.com/Bert-JanP/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/main/DFIR/Defender%20For%20Identity/MDI%20-%20Devices-Accessed-By-Compromised-Device.md
// Section: Defender XDR
