// Title: Hunt for malicious files that have been identified by CERT-FR
// Source: https://github.com/Bert-JanP/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/main/Threat%20Hunting/TI%20Feed%20-%20CERT-FR-MISPFeed.md
