// Title: List all Global Admins in your tenant
// Source: https://github.com/Bert-JanP/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/main/Sentinel/ListGlobalAdmins.md
// Section: Sentinel
// Author: Bert-JanP
// Description:
// This query lists all accounts that have the Global Admin role assigned to their account. If you have enabled PIM, then only users that have pimmed to Global Admin in the search period will be shown.

IdentityInfo
