// Title: Storm-0539 AiTM URLs - EmailEvents
// Source: https://github.com/Bert-JanP/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/main/Threat%20Hunting/STORM-0539%20URLPathsEmail.md
// Section: Defender XDR
