// Title: Unauthorized Logon actions by Domain and Account
// Source: https://github.com/Bert-JanP/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/main/Defender%20For%20Endpoint/Visualizations/Visualization%20-%20UnauthorizedLogonsByAccount.md
// Section: Defender XDR
// Author: Bert-JanP
