// Title: Heartbeat-Last heartbeats.kql
// Source: https://www.kqlsearch.com/query/Heartbeat-Last%20heartbeats&clmo1qhod005cmc0jsm3qdq3u
// Section: KQL
// Author: Jose Sebastián Canós
// Description:
