// Title: KQL to detect new chromium browser extension installation on MDE endpoints by Emerald Sleet (APT43).kql
// Source: https://www.kqlsearch.com/query/KQL%20to%20detect%20new%20chromium%20browser%20extension%20installation%20on%20MDE%20endpoints%20by%20Emerald%20Sleet%20(APT43)&clzh20m5400175ivothr8esrt
// Section: KQL
// Author: Steven Lim
// Description:
// KQL to detect new chromium browser extension installation on MDE endpoints by Emerald Sleet (APT43)
// https://www.linkedin.com/posts/activity-7212205082002513922-WGt4/
// Emerald Sleet (APT43) deploying faked google translate extension to exfiltrate user email, password and cookie data. Targeting users in the U.S., Europe, and South Korea.
