// Title: Orphaned Security Agent Detection
// Source: https://www.kqlsearch.com/query/Orphaned%20Security%20Agent%20Detection&cmr9mo2du0000102lw2ib0iy6
// Section: Defender XDR
// Author: Benjamin Zulliger
// Description:
