// Title: Sign-in Attempts Using Deprecated TLS Versions
// Source: https://www.kqlsearch.com/query/Sign-in%20Attempts%20Using%20Deprecated%20TLS%20Versions&cmfn9lw1p0000z7kjn69fr3s1
// Section: KQL
// Author: Sergio Albea
// Description:
// **MITRE ATT&CK Technique(s)**

AADSignInEventsBeta
| where ErrorCode == 0
| mv-apply d = parse_json(AuthenticationProcessingDetails) on (
    extend key = tostring(d.key), value = tostring(d.value)
