// Title: SocGhoulish.kql
// Source: https://www.kqlsearch.com/query/SocGhoulish&cm0mw3fgj00rsmc0p388amswm
// Section: KQL
// Author: Rod Trent
// Description:
// Detects SocGhoulish which does the following:
